.TP
.B "Argument 1 (choice:bash,zsh,fish,powershell)"
Completion shell
.SS "dots wttr get"
Print one weather field
.PP
.B "dots wttr get FIELD [OPTIONS]"
.TP
.B "\-\-location, \-l VALUE"
Override configured location or automatic city
.TP
.B "\-\-current, \-c"
Show current conditions only
.TP
.B "\-\-days, \-d 1,2,3"
Number of forecast days (default: 3)
.TP
.B "\-\-hourly, \-H"
Include three\-hourly forecast rows
.TP
.B "\-\-units, \-u us,metric"
Temperature, wind and precipitation units
.TP
.B "\-\-language, \-L VALUE"
Weather description language (default: en)
.TP
.B "\-\-widget, \-w"
Print a compact cached widget; refresh in background
.TP
.B "\-\-format, \-f VALUE"
Widget template with fields and style directives
.TP
.B "\-\-get, \-g location,attribution,condition,code,icon,temperature,unit,feels_like,humidity,wind,wind_unit,wind_direction,precipitation,precipitation_unit,sunrise,sunset,daylight,age,stale,stale_marker,wind_icon,sunrise_icon,sunset_icon,humidity_icon,precip_icon,location_icon"
Print one field; also: wttr get FIELD
.TP
.B "\-\-fields, \-F"
List available template and scalar fields
.TP
.B "\-\-json, \-j"
Print the original wttr.in j1 object
.TP
.B "\-\-daylight"
Print day, night or unknown; refresh in background
.TP
.B "\-\-refresh, \-r"
Refresh now, overriding freshness and cooldown
.TP
.B "\-\-cached"
Read only; never spawn, locate, lock or write
.TP
.B "\-\-allow\-stale"
Allow marked weather up to max_stale age
.TP
.B "\-\-config, \-C VALUE"
Use this TOML configuration file
.TP
.B "\-\-timeout, \-t VALUE"
Total refresh deadline (1–60 seconds)
.TP
.B "\-\-color auto,always,never"
Human and widget output colors
.TP
.B "\-\-icons auto,always,never"
Weather icons (widget auto uses icons)
.TP
.B "\-\-verbose, \-v"
Show cache provenance and age in human output
.TP
.B "\-\-help, \-h"
Show usage without querying providers
.TP
.B "\-\-version, \-V"
Print version
.TP
.B "Argument 1 (choice:location,attribution,condition,code,icon,temperature,unit,feels_like,humidity,wind,wind_unit,wind_direction,precipitation,precipitation_unit,sunrise,sunset,daylight,age,stale,stale_marker,wind_icon,sunrise_icon,sunset_icon,humidity_icon,precip_icon,location_icon)"
Weather field
