Show global or command help
.PP
.B "dots help [ROUTE...]"
.SS "dots init"
Print native shell initialization or explicitly set up files
.PP
.B "dots init [bash|zsh|fish|powershell|nu|xonsh] | \-\-bootstrap bash|zsh|powershell | \-\-setup [OPTIONS]"
.TP
.B "\-\-verbose, \-v"
Show setup actions and backups
.TP
.B "\-\-bootstrap bash,zsh,powershell"
Print standalone missing\-checkout startup bootstrap
.TP
.B "\-\-setup"
Install platform configurations with retained backups
.TP
.B "\-\-dry\-run"
Preview setup without writes
.TP
.B "\-\-yes"
Approve setup without prompting
.TP
.B "\-\-json"
Emit setup JSON
.TP
.B "\-\-update"
Update clean sources before setup
.TP
.B "\-\-with\-source termux,windows,nvim"
Select a bundled platform source or initialize nvim
.TP
.B "\-\-packages VALUE"
Restore a package manifest during explicit setup
.TP
.B "\-\-interactive"
Open the setup wizard
.TP
.B "\-\-non\-interactive"
Skip the wizard; writes require \-\-yes
.TP
.B "\-\-component core,files,themes,anodize,blastoff,pkgs,packages,fonts,leaf"
Select components instead of defaults; repeat
.TP
.B "\-\-resource VALUE"
Select enabled catalog IDs within Files; repeat
.TP
.B "\-\-no\-clear"
Retain the visible screen on wizard entry
.TP
.B "\-\-no\-logo"
Omit the wizard logo
.TP
.B "\-\-with\-dependencies"
Offer mapped missing prerequisites before preparation
.TP
.B "\-\-save\-choices"
Save successful choices in the active profile
.TP
.B "\-\-fonts VALUE"
Restore exact font preferences
.TP
.B "\-\-font\-target termux,kitty,wezterm,windows\-terminal,vscode\-editor,vscode\-terminal"
Select saved font targets; repeat
.TP
.B "Argument 1 (choice:bash,zsh,fish,powershell,nu,xonsh)"
Shell adapter (default: Bash/Zsh)
.PP
.nf
eval \(dq$(dots init)\(dq
.fi
.PP
.nf
dots init fish | source
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
dots help files
dots menu
dots files install --dry-run
dots wiki search "config precedence" --topics
dots config explain apps.menu.popup.width
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DOTS
Select the checkout used by command adapters.
.TP
.B DOTS_COLOR, DOTS_ICONS, NO_COLOR
Control human presentation. Structured output and completion remain
undecorated.
.TP
.B DOTS_PROGRESS
Set to never to disable operation progress.
.TP
.B DOTS_WIKI_DIR
Override the separate generated wiki checkout location.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_STATE_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME
Override supported POSIX configuration, state and data roots. Native Windows
uses its own platform destinations; see the Platforms and PowerShell guides.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B profiles/ID/profile.json
Profile mappings, settings and application environment declarations.
.TP
.B default/
Shared configuration and theme templates.
.TP
.B .dots/files.json, .dots/sources.json
Managed resource identities and source repositories.
.TP
.B .dots/wiki.json
Canonical documentation mappings and wiki navigation.
.SH SAFETY
Review the selected command help and supported dry-run before a managed
change.
Managed file changes use preflight, journals and retained recovery records.
Undo refuses destructive restoration after drift. Package and external effects
have their own boundaries; filesystem rollback cannot undo every external
action.
Documentation lookup does not install, activate or publish anything.
